mi_Growup_2.ogg","category":"growup","text":"ふふーん、先生！もっと私に頼ってもいいのよ！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%A8%20%E5%A5%BD%E7%BE%8E/eYVvc9nh9qZXKJToOdtCzSEFZ8tk0FJT.ogg"},{"description":"Yoshimi_Growup_3.ogg","category":"growup","text":"よぉーし！私、これでもっと強くなった！きっと背も伸びたよね！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%A8%20%E5%A5%BD%E7%BE%8E/2ddGIF7lEBS5WGBek3dgSOq7vyRQkRCf.ogg"},{"description":"Yoshimi_Growup_4.ogg","category":"growup","text":"ありがとう先生。…いつか恩返しするから。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%A8%20%E5%A5%BD%E7%BE%8E/fY0deaN6x3GIjrsSFEF7uWkznNyZsxPp.ogg"},{"description":"Yoshimi_Lobby_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"牛乳なら1L飲んでる。仕方なく、毎日、毎日、毎日ね！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%A8%20%E5%A5%BD%E7%BE%8E/ElxgP7ROKnwTBrwPCTpZfodEEEkcQP76.ogg"},{"description":"Yoshimi_Lobby_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":" と、当番になれば、先生と美味しいお菓子を食べる時間があるはずよね？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%A8%20%E5%A5%BD%E7%BE%8E/4bhJpORr8ALlk5icYFgvRcwPWRxTihhl.ogg"},{"description":"Yoshimi_Lobby_3.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"ほら、今日も頑張って！私が手伝ってあげるから！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%A8%20%E5%A5%BD%E7%BE%8E/l1a3ddE4UNTE7HLgin10J3WwULVOZaOQ.ogg"},{"description":"Yoshimi_Lobby_4.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"あの、先生、疲れてない？ お、美味しいスイーツでも食べに行く？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%A8%20%E5%A5%BD%E7%BE%8E/ZG8Y4NNy6KSf29uW2sVOBe8yCPRzjHVf.ogg"},{"description":"Yoshimi_Lobby_5.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"ほら！私がいる限りサボろうとするのは諦めなさい！さ、仕事の時間よ！任務を始めましょう！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%A8%20%E5%A5%BD%E7%BE%8E/QabO3PLyPqNGW3SXKqOisiWo8sd3T8yk.ogg"},{"description":"Yoshimi_LogIn_1.ogg","category":"lobby","t