{"description":"Yoshimi_Season_Birthday_Player.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"誕生日おめでとう、先生！近くに良いスイーツ屋さんがあるの、行こ！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%A8%20%E5%A5%BD%E7%BE%8E/klK7XpmZDb8e4h6EW45az82ryJCIAlsf.ogg"},{"description":"Yoshimi_Season_Halloween.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"誕生日おめでとう、先生！近くに良いスイーツ屋さんがあるの、行こ！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%A8%20%E5%A5%BD%E7%BE%8E/27Gr3dKhjWWhUMgGjqforGD9kn17lAuM.ogg"},{"description":"Yoshimi_Season_NewYear.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"明けましておめでとう！今年の目標？そんなの決まってるでしょ！ナイスバディになることよ！！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%A8%20%E5%A5%BD%E7%BE%8E/uawYa2TF8HAdn20lFQYQgqmfNzapoTen.ogg"},{"description":"Yoshimi_Season_Xmas.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"メリークリスマス！クリスマスって大好き！街が、私の好きな色でいっぱいになるから！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%A8%20%E5%A5%BD%E7%BE%8E/YGuaU3HF2a55FTI02S4hY2209Ab42zq0.ogg"},{"description":"Yoshimi_MemorialLobby_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"ほんと、先生には驚かされっぱなしっていうか、","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%A8%20%E5%A5%BD%E7%BE%8E/kxERKb79ZyBWlQ2KLHeU9oNWgnrobLqu.ogg"},{"description":"Yoshimi_MemorialLobby_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"振り回されっぱなしっていうか……。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%A8%20%E5%A5%BD%E7%BE%8E/zt5ilnTTfB5SlSSyQbuodeMVVbijGKKn.ogg"},{"description":"Yoshimi_MemorialLobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"……ん？何をそんな、じっと見てるわけ？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%A8%20%E5%A5%BD%E7%BE%8E/aqvdOu31RpKy6RNf6rsm9UPkeUY2KfYj.ogg"},{"description":"Yoshimi_MemorialLobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"ねぇ、まさかまた変なこと考えてないでしょうね？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%A8%20%E5%A5%BD%E7%BE%8E/ZpG53Esl6CZOySsZTzLuzy6ilKxM1egS.ogg"},{"description":"Yoshimi_MemorialLobby_3_1","category":"lobby","text":"私は先生のオモチャじゃないんだから、","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%A8%20%E5%A5%BD%E7%BE%8E/SrtZrcKOYZpPcdlS01whcSEMS0KgXX6C.ogg"},{"description":"Yoshimi_MemorialLobby_3_2","category":"lobby","text":"いい加減やめないと本当に怒るよ。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%A8%20%E5%A5%BD%E7%BE%8E/3HK0DUpGYxAVZ05HwhShq1J0Lp8L6hvW.ogg"},{"description":"Yoshimi_MemorialLobby_4","category":"lobby","text":"……いやまあ、別に心の底から嫌、ってわけじゃないけど……。 ……ふふっ。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%A8%20%E5%A5%BD%E7%BE%8E/8wZgnVPmiNQh4wb1pGWYhqVFpkq0DJ1a.ogg"},{"description":"Yoshimi_MemorialLobby_5_1","category":"lobby","text":"（いつか……）","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%A8%20%E5%A5%BD%E7%BE%8E/2kdNPMufhCf0r96Usq98mPpwEUxCIg3c.ogg"},{"description":"Yoshimi_MemorialLobby_5_2","category":"lobby","text":"（いつかこうやって隣に……堂々と、並んで歩ける日が……）","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%A8%20%E5%A5%BD%E7%BE%8E/cZqI8u3NTsFLGUIErcVSUnov1DTsMxGc.ogg"},{"description":"好美DyDo联动语音","category":"other","text":"你转发了啊......谢，谢谢了！","text_original":"りポスト、してくれたんだ......。あ、ありがとっ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%A8%20%E5%A5%BD%E7%BE%8E/original/%E3%83%A8%E3%82%B7%E3%83%9F_1.mp3"},{"description":"好美DyDo联动语音2","category":"other","text":"谢谢转发。有点……不，这次真是一个超级棒的夏天！","text_original":"りポストありがとね。少しは......ううん、すごく素敵な夏になった！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%A8%20%E5%A5%BD%E7%BE%8E/original/jp/%E5%A5%BD%E7%BE%8EDyDo%E8%81%94%E5%8A%A8%E8%AF%AD%E9%9F%B32.wav"},{"description":"yoshimi_formation_select","category":"formation","text":"","text_original":"ひゃっ！？き、急になによ！？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%A8%20%E5%A5%BD%E7%BE%8E/original/jp/yoshimi_formation_select.ogg"}],"voice_cn":[{"description":"Yoshimi_Title.ogg","category":"other","text":"Blue Archive","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%A8%20%E5%A5%BD%E7%BE%8E/5WB1Vp4wK6HtxGkU6sDNalupkcmmJoso.ogg"},{"description":"yoshimi_battle_in_1.ogg","category":"battle","text":"打垮他们！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%A8%20%E5%A5%BD%E7%BE%8E/mjmkeq7W7pIj4zVd3yG8g12HkMoLy1KD.ogg"},{"description":"yoshimi_battle_in_2.ogg","category":"battle","text":"饶不了你！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%A8%20%E5%A5%BD%E7%BE%8E/k7rlcGFdKLWJa0JsujzDuiPYqTyzMNGG.ogg"},{"description":"yoshimi_cafe_act_1.ogg","category":"cafe","text":"我想吃好吃的点心——！啊，老师！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%A8%20%E5%A5%BD%E7%BE%8E/lnKRwe6lC3kGIUH1XTAGT6lcGCaqs79f.ogg"},{"description":"yoshimi_cafe_act_2.ogg","category":"cafe","text":"嗯？诶……我讨厌牛奶。因为我知道必须要喝，所以更讨厌了！诶？是，是草莓牛奶吗？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%A8%20%E5%A5%BD%E7%BE%8E/Q2KuY9gBEzEIggVzsggvKDLwpoFpxzjw.ogg"},{"description":"yoshimi_cafe_monolog_1.ogg","category":"cafe","text":"……我还没有发育完呢！真的！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%A8%20%E5%A5%BD%E7%BE%8E/Ql2yRu4jFo5pem9XmJdPPagDdtZPXwMN.ogg"},{"description":"yoshimi_cafe_monolog_2.ogg","category":"cafe","text":"嘿嘿。要不要打个盹儿呢。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%A8%20%E5%A5%BD%E7%BE%8E/kV86UjmyxQhNf2cK76kIPymCiX3zL5zL.ogg"},{"description":"yoshimi_cafe_monolog_3.ogg","category":"cafe","text":"唉……老师为什么这么不会看人眼色呢。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%A8%20%E5%A5%BD%E7%BE%8E/A9gGXUJqToq2NGClgR8bwDWhoziRHIEk.ogg"},{"description":"yoshimi_commonskill.ogg","category":"battle","text":"这招如何？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%A8%20%E5%A5%BD%E7%BE%8E/Wydejvo6N9aMfxaGbis9chDcsMRPfYko.ogg"},{"description":"yoshimi_exskill_1.ogg","category":"battle","text":"吃我一发！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%A8%20%E5%A5%BD%E7%BE%8E/uPaf09rrzpCHeQEZX3QuqoangrdH3qYO.ogg"},{"description":"yoshimi_exskill_2.ogg","category":"battle","text":"哼，干掉你！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%A8%20%E5%A5%BD%E7%BE%8E/dKBBSa5LjioTA6zQGXZTuXzO3UaGN7Qi.ogg"},{"description":"yoshimi_exskill_3.ogg","category":"battle","text":"给我死心吧！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%A8%20%E5%A5%BD%E7%BE%8E/LnAkPOZEPXNTQULUOWYP9KmprtBcSTBP.ogg"},{"description":"yoshimi_exskill_level_1.ogg","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%A8%20%E5%A5%BD%E7%BE%8E/9dVcRBDho6bd1xfK1gxhq4IVfqIz6iIt.ogg"},{"description":"yoshimi_exskill_level_2.ogg","category":"battle","text":"这发怎么样？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%A8%20%E5%A5%BD%E7%BE%8E/BRCbG0HQBLKL6hQwOQcQpsQSG0FLWwMF.ogg"},{"description":"yoshimi_exskill_level_3.ogg","category":"battle","text":"再吃一发！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%A8%20%E5%A5%BD%E7%BE%8E/MuYaQAQ6m4qCdfZsTbCW7XTeYzQD2A4Q.ogg"},{"description":"yoshimi_exweapon_get.ogg","category":"growup","text":"收下这种东西……不就只能尽全力了嘛！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%A8%20%E5%A5%BD%E7%BE%8E/Us39UicvOlfFblUqCVNX6TRQjdfunCdm.ogg"},{"description":"yoshimi_formation_in_1.ogg","category":"formation","text":"我可是专程过来和大家会合的，还不快谢谢我？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%A8%20%E5%A5%BD%E7%BE%8E/q5r3eFobQzVgDvjefKXmV8EPpXfK83c3.ogg"},{"description":"yoshimi_formation_in_2.ogg","category":"formation","text":"真没办法，走吧！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%A8%20%E5%A5%BD%E7%BE%8E/Ggy4MQRXx5JEMH8u3K5gNHmLI5Cw4LK3.ogg"},{"description":"yoshimi_gachaget.ogg","category":"growup","text":"别因为我个子小就看不起我！我的潜力可是很大的！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%A8%20%E5%A5%BD%E7%BE%8E/Q8QiFTZlP3qY53RiiFSpu5vghV4dytsx.ogg"},{"description":"yoshimi_growup_1.ogg","category":"growup","text":"谢……谢……谢谢！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%A8%20%E5%A5%BD%E7%BE%8E/0jKApsEqaVEH5YeSZSOHwZMJMVWglOi2.ogg"},{"description":"yoshimi_growup_2.ogg","category":"growup","text":"哼哼，老师，尽管放心交给我吧！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%A8%20%E5%A5%BD%E7%BE%8E/opGGOU5vJP4d65JJCwI4adWPhEh1Gapd.ogg"},{"description":"yoshimi_growup_3.ogg","category":"growup","text":"太好了！这样我就更强了，个子一定会长高吧！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%A8%20%E5%A5%BD%E7%BE%8E/5H2uiKUetxnGbs97igMP0pBY9l9NPkaR.ogg"},{"description":"yoshimi_growup_4.ogg","category":"growup","text":"谢谢老师，总有一天我会回报你的。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%A8%20%E5%A5%BD%E7%BE%8E/2LGzXZkljyGSENqg7IuJCfGHESIyDqSG.ogg"},{"description":"yoshimi_lobby_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"牛奶我每天都要喝一升。有什么办法，每天喝，每天喝，每天喝！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%A8%20%E5%A5%BD%E7%BE%8E/cPn205SdL7JCy2Bs642f6M338pnuWzRj.ogg"},{"description":"yoshimi_lobby_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"如，如果我值日，就有时间和老师一起吃好吃的零食了吧？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%A8%20%E5%A5%BD%E7%BE%8E/lrdME8n0peW49ffpYaisvjSngTm7k22q.ogg"},{"description":"yoshimi_lobby_3.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"好啦，今天也加油吧！我也会帮你的！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%A8%20%E5%A5%BD%E7%BE%8E/PnedewscGuhkNhkIk0Ll5OeBd35bz7r7.ogg"},{"description":"yoshimi_lobby_4.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"那个，老师你累不累啊？ 要，要不要一起去吃好吃的甜点啊？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%A8%20%E5%A5%BD%E7%BE%8E/Jd5FWooYWSCw2Y2qpyLTqb6jMF67bQx8.ogg"},{"description":"yoshimi_lobby_5.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"喂！我在这儿盯着你还想偷懒啊！来，该干活了！开始执行任务吧！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%A8%20%E5%A5%BD%E7%BE%8E/frzF4xTFCsdvNOgnvZV6j3suNDMyv9wF.ogg"},{"description":"yoshimi_login_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"别摸我的头！真是的……我讨厌别人把我当小孩。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%A8%20%E5%A5%BD%E7%BE%8E/7tM9i23FqXiCmaYrM2xTEaYjEzXOL01F.ogg"},{"description":"yoshimi_login_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"如果再过几年……我会不会看起来……就不只像是你的妹妹了呢？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%A8%20%E5%A5%BD%E7%BE%8E/W1gSO7sjiTlOK9jF1kAeNgYvKtLh9dzF.ogg"},{"description":"yoshimi_relationship_up_1.ogg","category":"growup","text":"怎，怎么说呢，那个，太，太尴尬了吧！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%A8%20%E5%A5%BD%E7%BE%8E/8ZeXOLWmedSoIQBhXM9lDfnQldUIrXGo.ogg"},{"description":"yoshimi_relationship_up_2.ogg","category":"growup","text":"今天，很开心。是，是真的！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%A8%20%E5%A5%BD%E7%BE%8E/S7uayiD065YdTq0N1Ay5WJD1JSRLFfg7.ogg"},{"description":"yoshimi_relationship_up_3.ogg","category":"growup","text":"别，别误会了，我只是觉得和老师在一起很开心而已……感觉好像说错话了！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%A8%20%E5%A5%BD%E7%BE%8E/WBPQj7Z9VXqDzBZ9tAIqLwEmtLkoXvDq.ogg"},{"description":"yoshimi_relationship_up_4.ogg","category":"growup","text":"谢，谢，谢谢。现，现在我只能想到这些话了，但是下次，那个……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%A8%20%E5%A5%BD%E7%BE%8E/eXC7NEo5XobiMged362LjvebOgEuiCCe.ogg"},{"description":"yoshimi_season_birthday.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"谢，谢谢你的祝福。 （还得过多少生日……才能让大家觉得，我们站在一起比较相称呢？）","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%A8%20%E5%A5%BD%E7%BE%8E/zkJapuC8TbbVjoQkrBclaKdbVb8G9tDE.ogg"},{"description":"yoshimi_season_birthday_player.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"老师，生日快乐！附近有家很棒的甜品店，走吧！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%A8%20%E5%A5%BD%E7%BE%8E/qo24qx3yc1YLtRZrfp1wd0E8E0fvFzAf.ogg"},{"description":"yoshimi_season_birthday2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"干，干嘛啊？我又没胡思乱想！一直盯着我干什么啊？！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%A8%20%E5%A5%BD%E7%BE%8E/G7I5Lk3DdrR8BRTpuUm5RxF0hhXUOG8W.ogg"},{"description":"yoshimi_season_halloween.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"不给糖，就捣蛋～对甜点部来说万圣节是很特别的节日！我们出去吧！ 我对幽灵没兴趣，但是吃糖要紧！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%A8%20%E5%A5%BD%E7%BE%8E/gvgPr6VbBviRKGOvmTQQq7y90qdu779P.ogg"},{"description":"yoshimi_season_newyear.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"新年快乐！今年的目标？那还用问吗！肯定是变成完美身材啊！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%A8%20%E5%A5%BD%E7%BE%8E/QuARLrsiZGF2svEtxaGFwP81tVADcn9P.ogg"},{"description":"yoshimi_season_xmas.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"圣诞快乐！我喜欢圣诞节！因为街上到处都是我喜欢的颜色！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%A8%20%E5%A5%BD%E7%BE%8E/a6HhdNHSBe8mK72ZozaND7SVbCUQsk2S.ogg"},{"description":"yoshimi_season_chinesenewyear","category":"lobby","text":"新春快乐！今年一定能长得更高！绝对不会再被当成小孩子了！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%A8%20%E5%A5%BD%E7%BE%8E/ZfrczT607MsmbC14zM1BJoYjDayg7R9g.ogg"},{"description":"yoshimi_season_midautumn","category":"lobby","text":"月饼也算一种甜点吧，呐，分你一块。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%A8%20%E5%A5%BD%E7%BE%8E/Vy0GZ7zUearkK4nBLHRHrSbLsg3cTHM1.ogg"},{"description":"yoshimi_memoriallobby_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"非常感谢您…… 连我的份也一起买了，老师。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%A8%20%E5%A5%BD%E7%BE%8E/original/cn/yoshimi_memoriallobby_1_1.ogg"},{"description":"yoshimi_memoriallobby_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"甜……甜甜的好好吃啊！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%A8%20%E5%A5%BD%E7%BE%8E/original/cn/yoshimi_memoriallobby_1_2.ogg"},{"description":"yoshimi_memoriallobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"平常都是在咖啡厅 吃冰淇淋，感觉好久好久 没在外面吃了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%A8%20%E5%A5%BD%E7%BE%8E/original/cn/yoshimi_memoriallobby_2_1.ogg"},{"description":"yoshimi_memoriallobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"而且还是跟老师一起， 诶嘿嘿。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%A8%20%E5%A5%BD%E7%BE%8E/original/cn/yoshimi_memoriallobby_2_2.ogg"},{"description":"yoshimi_memoriallobby_3_1","category":"lobby","text":"不，没有， 完全没有啦。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%A8%20%E5%A5%BD%E7%BE%8E/original/cn/yoshimi_memoriallobby_3_1.ogg"},{"description":"yoshimi_memoriallobby_3_2","category":"lobby","text":"反而有种很怀念的感觉， 好开心。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%A8%20%E5%A5%BD%E7%BE%8E/original/cn/yoshimi_memoriallobby_3_2.ogg"},{"description":"yoshimi_memoriallobby_4","category":"lobby","text":"不仅开心，而且……感觉真安静啊…… 周围也没有什么人……不知道该不该说， 我感觉心在怦怦乱跳…… ……没，没， 没有没有！请您当我 什么都没说吧！哈哈，啊哈哈……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%A8%20%E5%A5%BD%E7%BE%8E/original/cn/yoshimi_memoriallobby_4.ogg"},{"description":"yoshimi_memoriallobby_5_1","category":"lobby","text":"……谢谢您，老师。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%A8%20%E5%A5%BD%E7%BE%8E/original/cn/yoshimi_memoriallobby_5_1.ogg"},{"description":"yoshimi_memoriallobby_5_2","category":"lobby","text":"多亏有老师在， 今天真的好幸福。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%A8%20%E5%A5%BD%E7%BE%8E/original/cn/yoshimi_memoriallobby_5_2.ogg"}],"voice_kr":[{"description":"yoshimi_exskill_2","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%A8%20%E5%A5%BD%E7%BE%8E/original/yoshimi_exskill_2.ogg"},{"description":"yoshimi_exskill_3","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%A8%20%E5%A5%BD%E7%BE%8E/original/yoshimi_exskill_3.ogg"},{"description":"yoshimi_exskill_level_1","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%A8%20%E5%A5%BD%E7%BE%8E/original/yoshimi_exskill_level_1.ogg"},{"description":"yoshimi_exskill_level_2","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%A8%20%E5%A5%BD%E7%BE%8E/original/yoshimi_exskill_level_2.ogg"},{"description":"yoshimi_exskill_level_3","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%A8%20%E5%A5%BD%E7%BE%8E/original/yoshimi_exskill_level_3.ogg"},{"description":"yoshimi_exweapon_get","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%A8%20%E5%A5%BD%E7%BE%8E/original/yoshimi_exweapon_get.ogg"},{"description":"yoshimi_gachaget","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%A8%20%E5%A5%BD%E7%BE%8E/original/yoshimi_gachaget.ogg"},{"description":"yoshimi_growup_1","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.